                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>Based on the fundamental principles of life sciences, medicinal chemistry and other disciplines, <strong>Drug Design</strong> is an emerging subject that elucidates the basic methodologies of drug design, as well as new technologies and frontiers in drug discovery throughout new‑drug research. It also serves as a specialized course to cultivate innovative thinking and independent working capabilities for undergraduate students majoring in biomedicine‑related disciplines.</p>
<p>This course has been awarded the <strong>Second‑Class National Teaching Achievement Award</strong>, the <strong>First‑Class Shanghai Municipal Teaching Achievement Award</strong>, and recognized as a <strong>Shanghai Excellent Course / Shanghai Key Course</strong>, as well as a <strong>National First‑Class Undergraduate Course</strong>.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
